{
  "provider": "prismhr",
  "entity": "direct_deposit",
  "notes": [
    "One DirectDeposit per getEmployee employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[] item (D-046). PrismHR sends no id or sequence: the canonical id is built from (client, employee, position in the list), sequence is null with not_provided, and every record carries an unstable_id diagnostic. The position is never read as a payment priority.",
    "company_id from the client; employee_id from (client, employee id), as the employee adapter builds them (D-080).",
    "applies_to_paycheck_kinds: one coded value per letter of the item's voucherTypeOverride when it is filled (documented as a subset of the block's voucherType), else of the block's voucherType. Live: block RVS and override RVS on the 1 sampled deposit.",
    "Last 4 (CANONICAL_MODEL 1.4): routing_last4 and account_last4 are filled only from a masked value that shows its last characters; next to a full value they are null with not_applicable, and next to a mask that shows nothing (accountNum '****') null with hidden_by_source.",
    "Step 4 (D-081): the hsa block (HSA contribution transfers) and getACHDeductions (deduction transfers, deselected) are not deposits; the hsa block stays on the employee (employee.json)."
  ],
  "fields": [
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].transitNum", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.routing_number", "transform": "copy", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/transitNum", "D-024"], "note": "Returned in full (D-024); sensitive, masked in output by default."},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].accountNum", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.account_number", "transform": "masked", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/accountNum", "D-024", "live: '****' on 1 of 1"], "note": "Provider-masked: account_number null with hidden_by_source and value_redacted_in_source; account_last4 from the visible last characters when the mask shows them (transform last4), else null with hidden_by_source."},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].accountType", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.account_type", "transform": "code:prismhr.deposit_account_type", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/accountType"], "note": "C stays checking_or_pay_card; never resolved to one of the two."},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].method", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.allocation_type", "transform": "code:prismhr.deposit_method", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/method", "D-032"], "note": "Also sets percent_basis: PN remainder_after_fixed (documented 'percentage of net after fixed'), P unknown with raw code P (no basis stated); not_applicable for F, FS and B. skip_if_insufficient: true for FS, false for F, not_applicable otherwise."},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].amount", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.amount", "transform": "number", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/amount", "D-032"], "note": "Fills amount for F and FS, percent for P and PN (scale 0 to 100, provisional, D-032); not sent for B ('must not be specified'), so amount and percent are not_applicable there."},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].limit", "use": "extension", "target": "DirectDeposit.provider_extensions", "reason": "Documented only as 'permissible only when method is P'; it does not say what it limits (CANONICAL_MODEL 5).", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/limit"]},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].status", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.status", "transform": "code:prismhr.deposit_status", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/status", "live: D on 1 of 1"], "note": "prenote_status is null with not_provided: PrismHR sends only the P status."},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].bankName", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.bank_name", "transform": "copy", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/bankName"]},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achVoucher[].voucherTypeOverride", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.applies_to_paycheck_kinds", "transform": "code:prismhr.deposit_voucher_type", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/AchVoucher/properties/voucherTypeOverride", "live: RVS on 1 of 1"], "note": "Used when filled (see notes)."},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.voucherType", "use": "mapped", "target": "DirectDeposit.applies_to_paycheck_kinds", "transform": "code:prismhr.deposit_voucher_type", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/EmployeeDirectDeposit/properties/voucherType", "live: RVS on 2 of 6 sampled employees"], "note": "Used when the item's voucherTypeOverride is empty."},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.achStatus", "use": "extension", "target": "DirectDeposit.provider_extensions", "reason": "Employee-level ACH switch (A active, I inactive): kept on each deposit, not combined into its status, since no precedence between the two is documented. Live: A on the 1 employee with a deposit, blank on 5.", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/EmployeeDirectDeposit/properties/achStatus"]},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.suppressAccountPrint", "use": "extension", "target": "DirectDeposit.provider_extensions", "reason": "Deposit advice print setting.", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/EmployeeDirectDeposit/properties/suppressAccountPrint"]},
    {"route": "/employee/v1/getEmployee", "field": "employee[].directDeposit.directDepositChecksum", "use": "excluded", "reason": "Checksum for updates (write concurrency), not data.", "evidence": ["contracts/prismhr/openapi/prismhr-2025.09.openapi.json#/components/schemas/EmployeeDirectDeposit/properties/directDepositChecksum"]}
  ],
